       <property name="whatsThis">
        <string>A comment field that is included when exporting this line from the Creation Kit. It isn't shown in-game. This is generally useful for things like stage directions, e.g. advising a voice actor on what a character is thinking as they say this line of dialogue (when that isn't obvious from context).</string>
